  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Reforma Institucional del Sector Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Sector Institutional Reform Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAST DISBURSING LOAN. DISBURSEMENTS WILL BE MADE AGAINST COMPLIANCE WITH INSTITUTIONAL REFORMS AND MEASURES THAT: (1) STRENGTHEN THE NORMATIVE FRAMEWORK OF THE HEALTH AND EDUCATION MINISTRIES; (2) PROTECT HEALTH AND EDUCATION EXPENDITURES AND INCREASE EFFICIENCY IN PUBLIC EXPENSES IN THOSE TWO SECTORS; AND (3) STRENGTHEN INTER-SECTORAL COORDINATION AND INST CAPACITIES TO FORMULATE, IMPLEMENT, AND EVALUATE SOCIAL POLICY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
